WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.936
The scripts only exist
inside Learn's pages,

2
00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:06.703
so the repository pins the
pages themselves, unmodified,

3
00:00:06.703 --> 00:00:11.513
at a known commit, with hashes a test
checks and a weekly watch for changes.

4
00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:15.466
Then a small harness pulls each
script out of its pinned page

5
00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:19.262
at test time and runs it, as
published, against a fake tenant.

6
00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:22.958
Only the things it calls
outside itself are swapped out:

7
00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:27.137
the prompts, the screen output,
the sleep, and four Graph cmdlets.

8
00:00:27.137 --> 00:00:30.257
That way you can watch
Microsoft's own scripts behave,

9
00:00:30.257 --> 00:00:32.100
instead of taking them on trust.

10
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.430
Here's what that showed.
